  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u76301dc9\" id=\"u76301dc9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u43b9f82c\" id=\"u43b9f82c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(143, 145, 168)\">一个可运行的 Linux 系统通常由 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua84820c5\" id=\"ua84820c5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: inherit\">引导程序（Bootloader）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufd15e1e6\" id=\"ufd15e1e6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(143, 145, 168)\">、</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ueb80baac\" id=\"ueb80baac\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: inherit\">Linux 内核（Kernel）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u821f6685\" id=\"u821f6685\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(143, 145, 168)\"> 和 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub71a7156\" id=\"ub71a7156\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: inherit\">根文件系统（Root Filesystem）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u944ee297\" id=\"u944ee297\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(143, 145, 168)\"> 三部分组成。 </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8b5130bc\" id=\"u8b5130bc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u84c6b6eb\" id=\"u84c6b6eb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">其中：</span></p><ul list=\"u5eda4afe\"><li fid=\"u0ef517eb\" data-lake-id=\"ubf3d90e4\" id=\"ubf3d90e4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u164e3335\" id=\"u164e3335\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">Bootloader 可以是 U-Boot（嵌入式）、GRUB（PC）、LILO、Coreboot 等。</span></li><li fid=\"u0ef517eb\" data-lake-id=\"ub40a0e77\" id=\"ub40a0e77\"><span data-lake-id=\"u224d1a57\" id=\"u224d1a57\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">Kernel 是 Linux 操作系统的核心。</span></li><li fid=\"u0ef517eb\" data-lake-id=\"u74cad5cd\" id=\"u74cad5cd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6031d5f6\" id=\"u6031d5f6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">RootFS 提供用户空间的运行环境。</span></li></ul><h1 data-lake-id=\"qcnJm\" id=\"qcnJm\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u51140eb4\" id=\"u51140eb4\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">SDK包介绍</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u80fb8b35\" id=\"u80fb8b35\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubc87888b\" id=\"ubc87888b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">开发Linux少不了和uboot, kernel, rootfs打交道。一些低端处理器这些源码往往都是单独给大家提供。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua4bb750c\" id=\"ua4bb750c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u45a2d8ee\" id=\"u45a2d8ee\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">但是随着处理器性能的提高，软件的依赖也越来越复杂，所以往往这些源码都是以SDK包的形式提供，SDK包里面有uboot, kernel, rootfs以及库文件和其他厂家自己的文件。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue629234d\" id=\"ue629234d\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F34933095%2F1757215707482-768f0dde-9cf5-488d-b8ff-307241a02a9f.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u4995f456-a9c4-48c6-bd42-806e84f65c6%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u180a635b-04f9-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A496%2C%22height%22%3A204%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A149563%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1116%2C%22originHeight%22%3A458%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%22%2C%22x%22%3A401%2C%22y%22%3A322%2C%22width%22%3A132%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%22%2C%22x%22%3A114%2C%22y%22%3A273%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINUX%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%22%2C%22x%22%3A107%2C%22y%22%3A40%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BOOT.IMG%22%2C%22x%22%3A625%2C%22y%22%3A114%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22UPDNTE.IMG%22%2C%22x%22%3A919%2C%22y%22%3A248%2C%22w