5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23faf1c7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uaf042194%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u46555c98\" id=\"u46555c98\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufbccfb0d\" id=\"ufbccfb0d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">瑞芯微官方的Linux源码里面只有buildroot、debian和yocto这三种文件系统，并没有其他的系统，如Ubuntu，openwrt等等。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"tLKy1\" id=\"tLKy1\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf958e97e\" id=\"uf958e97e\">泰山派SDK</span></h1><blockquote data-lake-id=\"uc0362f6b\" id=\"uc0362f6b\"><p data-lake-id=\"u2d8ffe47\" id=\"u2d8ffe47\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc44a4ce1\" id=\"uc44a4ce1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">通过资料中的tspi_linux_sdk_repo_20240131.tar.gz得到</span></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id=\"u01311c34\" id=\"u01311c34\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F34933095%2F1757237217569-ffd416db-02ce-490d-8778-4bd55685b08b.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u703831f0-69fc-4006-bc6d-07f48119480%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uec8cd84a-76ce-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A608%2C%22height%22%3A300%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A268190%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1368%2C%22originHeight%22%3A676%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%2236JAN192025NKFIRMWARE.SH-%3EDEVICE%2FROCKCHIP%2FCONMON%2FNKFIRMWA%22%2C%22x%22%3A424%2C%22y%22%3A419%2C%22width%22%3A860%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22-%3EDEVICE%2FROCKCHIP%2FCOMMON%2FRKFLASH.SH*%22%2C%22x%22%3A789%2C%22y%22%3A504%2C%22width%22%3A490%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2227JAN192025ENVSETUP%2CSH-%3EBUILDROOT%2FBUILDENVSETUP%2CSH*%22%2C%22x%22%3A416%2C%22y%22%3A306%2C%22width%22%3A800%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ITCAST%40UBUNTU%3A~%2FPROJTSPI_BUILDROOTSL%22%2C%22x%2